{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter Ground Seal, a Lo-fi Retro Sandbox RPG!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up in the future to a world with humanity on the brink of extinction. Discover the source of the radiation threatening the world and save civilization from a mysterious threat. This sandbox RPG features a gigantic world to explore, robust town building mechanics and a wide variety of items to craft! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A gigantic world to explore, procedural generation creates overlapping regions and you can even travel to different planets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day/night cycle. Different enemies may come out at night and even the seasons change in some regions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG Leveling System - Level up as you explore, fight mutants and complete quests. Tailor your build by spending skill points and specialize in melee, ranged, energy or minions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over a thousand items to craft and find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4 Person Multiplayer - Have your friends join to build, explore and fight a variety of epic bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NPC Classes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rescue NPCs and add them to your towns. They will perform tasks for you based upon their building's role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Forester.png?t=1745190268\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Soldier.png?t=1745190268\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Doctor.png?t=1745190268\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Scientist.png?t=1745190268\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Blacksmith.png?t=1745190268\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover different civilizations and build unique settlements on other planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Lunite.png?t=1745190268\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Robot.png?t=1745190268\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Xythian.png?t=1745190268\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intricate Electrical Systems. Wire up lights, machines and other gadgets. Control lighting and electrical signals through network controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Electrical.png?t=1745190268\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation - Link machines together with tubes and conveyer belts to create advanced recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Machinery.png?t=1745190268\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced town building features. Add buildings and assign them roles such as Blacksmith, Hospital, Forester and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/Buildings.png?t=1745190268\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3175290?t=1745190268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamst